{"4522150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crazy Caveman", "steam_appid": 4522150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life's too tiring? Become a caveman, relax,  Enjoy a carefree life on this beautiful island!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning island scenery that will captivate you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4522150/extras/5fe2ae63b63306da3296044ed1485c05.avif?t=1781707487\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4522150/extras_big/5fe2ae63b63306da3296044ed1485c05.webp?t=1781707487 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports single-player and multiplayer modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4522150/extras/14e63535da69335c4cc4eaebcda93ce0.avif?t=1781707487\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4522150/extras_big/14e63535da69335c4cc4eaebcda93ce0.avif?t=1781707487 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building system: Construct various buildings, create your own home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4522150/extras/4510441511903c99553268959958fb62.avif?t=1781707487\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4522150/extras_big/4510441511903c99553268959958fb62.avif?t=1781707487 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet system: Tame, ride, and feed various animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\